    <description>Source generators and supporting attribute types for AStar.Dev projects.</description>
    <releaseNotes>v0.1.8 - Fix NuGet package structure: analyzer DLL and Attributes DLL were missing due to MSBuild target ordering.
v0.1.7 - Fix bug in AutoRegisterServiceAttribute detection/code generation.
v0.1.6 - Fix build and packaging issues.
v0.1.5 - Update dependencies to latest Roslyn versions.
v0.1.4 - Add missing namespace in generated ServiceRegistrations class.
- Rename ServiceAttribute to AutoRegisterServiceAttribute for clarity</releaseNotes>
    <copyright>Copyright © 2026 AStar Development</copyright>
    <tags>source-generator strongid attributes astartools</tags>
    <dependencies />
  </metadata>
